3. Select this PR's branch
4. Uncheck "Only check for issues"
5. Run workflow

---

## 📋 Next Steps

${report.next_steps.map(step => `- ${step}`).join('\n')}

---

**Diagnostic Report**: [Download Artifact](${runUrl})
**Workflow Run**: [View Details](${runUrl})

