  `added without matching tests will cause the threshold check to fail in CI.`,
  `Recommended: add a pre-merge delta-coverage gate.`,
  ``,
  `🔗 [View details](${REPO_URL}/blob/0D_base_/.github/workflows/test-rag.yml#L157)`,
  ``,
  `### 3. Resilient Validation Suite matrix rescue comment coverage`,
  `**Category:** \`CI/CD · Rescue Workflow\``,
