  `S213-cont2 added the same pattern to \`actionlint-audit.yml\`.`,
  `Remaining gap: workflows outside validate.yml / resilient_validation.yml /`,
  `actionlint-audit.yml have no inline rescue step and are invisible to the`,
  `ci-rescue.yml workflow_run chain on PR branches.`,
  ``,
