  `intermittent failures due to SQLite locking when tests run in parallel.`,
  `Infrastructure flakes, not logic bugs. Suggested fix: \`@pytest.mark.serial\``,
  `or in-memory DB with WAL mode.`,
  ``,
  `🔗 [View details](${REPO_URL}/blob/0D_base_/tests/)`,
  ``,
  `### 5. MCP Server auth management gap (GAP-033)`,
  `**Category:** \`MCP Server · Security\``,
  ``,
