  `with no rotation, expiry detection, or retry logic. GAP-033 requires: expiry`,
  `check on startup, fallback to \`CODEX_BACKUP_KEY\`, exponential backoff on 401/403,`,
  `and a \`token_rotation_hook\`. S214 confirmed token identity is critical for`,
