markdown += `- ⏳ All 3 CCA variables present (validated by tests)\n`;
markdown += `- ⏳ All 5 dependent workflows validate (validated by tests)\n`;
markdown += `- ${totalFailed === 0 ? '✅' : '❌'} Security/secrets tests pass\n`;
markdown += `- ⏳ File size within acceptable range (validated by tests)\n`;
